      "explanation": "Sudden high fever combined with retro-orbital pain and severe arthralgia ('breakbone fever') strongly suggests Dengue infection.",
      "source": "cdc",
      "source_url": "https://www.cdc.gov/dengue/signs-symptoms/index.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "R27",
      "disease_id": "malaria",
